{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "70862dfda9ab40e8e4df0a2a67db4b590bea31ee48b386881b2254bcc373ae69", "ja": "（アイドル達が楽器を演奏しながらのパレードが\n終わった。お祭りも楽しめたみたいだな……）", "zh": "（偶像们一边演奏乐器一边进行的游行结束了。看来大家也好好享受了祭典……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5741b42ee79d5a608eaeb54b3bb23e381f3d959fef07918b163ffba6ec295214", "ja": "杏奈、昨日はお疲れさま。\nパレード、大盛況だったな！", "zh": "杏奈，昨天辛苦了。\n游行大获成功啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "f0ce06175978a59fc7fee187556d355f86f428e6a5d1f09872d378d6e6930bc1", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お疲れさま……。\nパレードも、お祭りも……楽しかった……です……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也辛苦了……\n游行也是，庆典也是……玩得……很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fc8c8a6604a147d92d4cefdfbfea04b26abf7863b9eff5e1138eb9e78f5ce1bf", "ja": "そうか。いい思い出になったのなら、何よりだよ。", "zh": "这样啊。能成为一段美好的回忆，那就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "c75f446a8185b34f1ef04ba7e3122192016bd70b4c0a2e041886b40284d587a3", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、怪獣さん……取って\nくれたし……。杏奈、すごく……うれしかった、です。", "zh": "{$P$}先生还帮我……抓到了\n怪兽先生……。杏奈真的……很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "138def9d9b8692e82d8e1b5cdd5216087ff37272cb8498a53f64b6e4acc77a36", "ja": "夜は……いっしょに、寝た……。\n怪獣さん……杏奈のお気に入り……だから……。", "zh": "晚上……还一起睡了……\n怪兽先生……是杏奈的心爱之物……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ece99fd462bb286685fb38bb55fb78f22611ae81b27944aae5cd69287cf09770", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n本当に大切にしてくれてるんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n你真的很珍惜它呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "277607c660ff4b1b87d0e41b69eb0520389e551d2510977a077f489707fdf698", "ja": "ん……{$P$}さんから、\nもらった……杏奈の、宝物……です。", "zh": "嗯……这是{$P$}先生送给我的……\n是杏奈的……宝物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "e2bf948f8f2c9f076719f507501b44d64318fc296f0d43cce25f18944a8c2cff", "ja": "でも、朝起きたら……怪獣さん、\n杏奈の……下敷きに、なってて……。", "zh": "可是早上醒来时……怪兽先生，\n被杏奈……压在身下了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "ce440b57f16ee07386f295d3c7099c350926409f44d6ff36539ca2ac331ea2f0", "ja": "すごく、かわいそうだった……\nけど、大切なのは……本当、です……。", "zh": "真的……很可怜……\n但是，重要的东西……是真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0f4c157a7c53841026b31c67843ce4c3c71711f449dcd038e376c7d21bc73036", "ja": "うん、大丈夫だよ。怪獣さんにも、杏奈が\n大切にしている気持ちは、伝わってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，没事的。怪兽肯定也能感受到\n杏奈珍惜它的心意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "45dc1f019b3fc46eebac64eb944148cf43cab9c48c0b22a772454435c8927d42", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。\nえっと……あのね。杏奈……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。\n那个……那个呢。杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "366969ff68a7074e7da464feebb0278674b64ba5ac80613533e51329c713ff19", "ja": "怪獣さんに……名前、\nつけてあげたい、です……。", "zh": "想给怪兽……取个名字……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f01cfece07c6971f8da8c0d18bbc796a517816f7e6acc2f35b32bd7f5fd80ead", "ja": "ぬいぐるみに名前か……その方が愛着もわくもんな。\nどんな名前をつけるつもりなんだ？", "zh": "给玩偶取名字吗……这样确实也会更有感情。\n你打算取什么名字？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "a224366c7c1b159dbb81185d84c774c9c264e768ad3eef88402b360c2dd56e20", "ja": "んと……『フルート』に……する……。", "zh": "嗯……想叫……“长笛”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f823c121db9ec73483b78c98656cc2f3d68c073f5bc08b5cf955eeb842bd2867", "ja": "フルート……。杏奈がパレードで吹いてた？", "zh": "长笛……是杏奈在游行时吹的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "365fea052af9f891dd4e333997033e6a872b8743a29d344031fbf15579d9bb34", "ja": "うん……。そうすれば、パレードと、お祭りのこと……\n怪獣さんを見れば、いつでも思い出せる……から……。", "zh": "嗯……这样一来，只要看到怪兽先生……就能随时想起游行和庆典的事……了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e9b27599b35ea3834b5629e8b169d8286e4b854e6dba7fd7eb81ce81963fdc96", "ja": "なるほどな。……うん、いい名前だと思う！\nそしたら、フルートの事、大切にしてあげてくれ。", "zh": "原来如此。……嗯，我觉得这是个不错的名字！\n那么，要好好珍惜长笛哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "a7cd53fbf7b70830118cf182bcb7d1c3866a0e6c8f219d93e65e21d14783eb45", "ja": "ん……。杏奈……フルートのこと、\nずっとずっと、大切にする……ね……♪", "zh": "嗯……。杏奈……会一直、一直\n好好珍惜……长笛的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0173_1019_p", "source_sha256": "45a0183b13fb4928561a88c6f31af77434b99dc0f3b38b18f4d96919c60b75bf", "ja": "（思い出は怪獣のぬいぐるみと一緒に、杏奈の\n傍に残り続けるはずだ。喜んでもらえてよかったな！）", "zh": "（这段回忆应该会和怪兽玩偶一起，永远留在杏奈身边。她能喜欢真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
